@startuml get-manager-coffee-chat-notification-log
skinparam defaultFontName "Apple SD Gothic Neo", "Noto Sans CJK KR", sans-serif
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam maxMessageSize 260
skinparam BoxPadding 8
skinparam shadowing false
autonumber
hide footbox

title GET /api/manager/v1/coffee-chat/notification-log
caption CRB-45 · 커피챗 알림 발송 결과 목록 (읽기 전용). 수신자는 응답하지 않음

actor Client
participant "ManagerGuard" as Guard
participant "ValidationPipe" as Pipe
participant "ManagerCoffeeChatController" as Controller
participant "ManagerCoffeeChatService" as Service
participant "AdminNotificationLogRepository" as LogRepository
database PostgreSQL

Client -> Guard: GET /api/manager/v1/coffee-chat/notification-log?channel&status&event&created_from&created_to&page&size\nAuthorization: Bearer <manager token>
ref over Client, Guard: ManagerGuard — flow/manager-guards.puml\n401 Missing access token / Token expired / Invalid token / Manager not found
Guard -> Pipe: 통과
alt query 검증 실패 (channel · status · event · 날짜 형식, page · size 범위)
  Pipe -[#red]-> Client: 400 (class-validator 메시지)
end
Pipe -> Controller: listNotificationLogs(query)
Controller -> Service: listNotificationLogs(query)
alt created_from이 created_to보다 늦음
  Service -[#red]-> Client: 400 created_from must not be after created_to
end
Service -> LogRepository: findPage(filter, offset, limit)
LogRepository -> PostgreSQL: SELECT notification_log ORDER BY created_at DESC, pk DESC LIMIT OFFSET
PostgreSQL --> LogRepository: rows
LogRepository -> PostgreSQL: SELECT count(*) (같은 조건)
PostgreSQL --> LogRepository: total
LogRepository --> Service: { rows, total }
note right of Service
  recipient는 응답에 넣지 않음.
  error는 이메일 · 전화번호를 가려서 응답 (maskPersonalInfo).
  탈퇴 처리 후에도 notification_log는 원문 그대로 남아 있음
end note
Service --> Controller: PageResponseDto<NotificationLogItemDto>
Controller --> Client: 200 { items: [{ pk, coffee_chat_request_pk, event, channel, status, error, created_at }], page, size, total }

@enduml
